  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 23*2*10*20*5 = 40 \n\nOption 1) +, ×, –, ÷\n\nSigns that can sequentially replace the * signs:\n\n⇒ 23 + 2 × 10 - __**20 ÷ 5**__ = 40 \n\n⇒ 23 + __**2 **____**× **____**10 **__- 4 = 40\n\n⇒ __**23 + 2**____**0**__ - 4 = 40\n\n⇒ __**43**____** - 4**__ = 40\n\n⇒ 39 = 40\n\n**Option 2) × − + ÷**\n\nSigns that can sequentially replace the * signs:\n\n⇒ 23 × 2 - 10 + **__20 ÷ 5__** = 40 \n\n⇒__** 23 **____**× **____**2**__ - 10 + 4 = 40\n\n⇒ **__46__** - 10__** + 4**__ = 40 \n\n⇒ **50 - 10** = 40 \n\n__**⇒ 40 = 40**__\n\nOption 3) − + ÷ ×\n\nSigns that can sequentially replace the * signs:\n\n⇒ 23 - 2 + __**10 ÷ 20**__ × 5 = 40 \n\n⇒ 23 - 2 + __**0.5 **____**× **____**5**__ = 40 \n\n⇒ __**23 **__- 2 __**+ 2.5**__ = 40 \n\n⇒ __**25.5 - 2**__ = 40 \n\n⇒ 23.5 = 40 \n\nOption 4) + − × ÷\n\nSigns that can sequentially replace the * signs:\n\n⇒ 23 + 2 - 10 × __**20 ÷ 5**__ = 40 \n\n⇒ 23 + 2 - __**10 × 4**____** **__= 40 \n\n⇒ __**23 + 2**__ - 40 = 40 \n\n⇒ __**25 - 40**__ = 40 \n\n⇒ -15 = 40 \n\nHence, the correct answer is \"× − + ÷\".",
